<section class="hero">
    <h1>Bitcoin vs. <em>Paying Down the Mortgage</em></h1>
    <div class="hero-subtitle">The homeowner&rsquo;s question: a mortgage at a fixed rate and some spare cash each month. Pay the loan off faster, or hold bitcoin?</div>
    <p class="subtitle">The page doesn&rsquo;t choose for you. It shows what each path does to the numbers under stated assumptions, the yearly growth bitcoin would need for holding to come out ahead, how often bitcoin has managed it, and the risks on both sides.</p>
</section>

